{"case_id": "capacity.named-comparison", "displayed_text": "The current Uniform Allowance Guidance increases both payments: the one-off new-starter (initial) allowance is now £55 in the first month’s pay, increased from £40 in the previous version; the annual replacement allowance paid every April is now £35, increased from £25 in the previous version.\n\nThe current Staff Handbook Full Manual offers a consolidated wellbeing and benefits summary including: the Employee Assistance Programme (confidential counselling and practical advice), a death-in-service benefit provided through the workplace pension scheme, access to an occupational health referral where a health condition affects someone’s ability to work, and a wellbeing check-in offered as part of the return-to-work process following sickness absence.\n\nUnder the current Resident Finances and Appointeeship Policy a “financial concern” is escalated to—and the Alderbridge Safeguarding Lead is now the escalation contact for—any financial concern raised at a site.", "finished_at": "2026-11-12T10:55:24+00:00", "frozen_scope": "primary", "needs_opt_in": ["5323cd6b-8b7a-40f9-98b0-9413c75f643e"], "needs_pipeline_exercised": true, "observation": {"assistant_message_kind": "grounded_answer", "case_id": "capacity.named-comparison", "contextualisation": {"clarification_question": null, "contextualiser_version": "authorised-user-turns-needs-v1", "interpretation_metadata": null, "resolved_query": null, "status": "resolved", "usage": null, "used_prior_context": false}, "failure_code": null, "generation": {"aspect_links": [{"answer_part_indices": [0], "need_id": "n1", "unsupported_aspect_indices": []}, {"answer_part_indices": [1], "need_id": "n2", "unsupported_aspect_indices": []}, {"answer_part_indices": [2], "need_id": "n3", "unsupported_aspect_indices": []}], "aspect_results": {"n1": "supported", "n2": "supported", "n3": "supported"}, "generation_fingerprint": "801819693156fd703272f92f0e194e3891a67c7ce631a5cf01d8805c67e6e